{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":1771183218639,"sessionID":"ses_39d430eecffenagK7FExfhPqyr","part":{"id":"prt_c62bdea45001uw85gsM3tm5OTx","sessionID":"ses_39d430eecffenagK7FExfhPqyr","messageID":"msg_c62bd7dde001jb8KK2gmeNytt7","type":"tool","callID":"call_fbc76f9dbe8f407fa242c4d2","tool":"task","state":{"status":"completed","input":{"description":"Check transition system integration","prompt":"I need to understand the current state of the transition system integration in the Game component and related files. Please:\n\n1. Read src/components/Game.tsx to see how transitions are currently integrated\n2. Read src/hooks/useTransition.ts to understand the transition implementation\n3. Read src/components/TransitionOverlay.tsx to see the overlay component\n4. Check if browser tab handling is implemented for transitions (Page Visibility API)\n5. Check if transition audio is connected\n6. Check if the transition flow completes properly from FINISHED phase through all states to next level\n7. Identify any missing pieces or bugs in the transition integration\n\nFocus on finding what's NOT working or what's missing from the transition system integration.","subagent_type":"explore"},"output":"task_id: ses_39d4215b6ffefFpnXnrNlj3Y93 (for resuming to continue this task if needed)\n\n<task_result>\nBased on my analysis of the transition system integration, I've identified several critical issues and missing pieces. Here's my comprehensive report:\n\n## Transition System Integration Analysis\n\n### 1. Page Visibility API - NOT IMPLEMENTED for Transitions ❌\n\n**Issue:** The spec (`specs/auto-advance-transitions.md` lines 96-99) explicitly states that when the user switches tabs mid-transition, the transition timer should pause and resume when the tab becomes active.\n\n**Current State:**\n- `usePhaseTimer.ts` (lines 35-65) has Page Visibility API implemented for phase timers\n- `useTransition.ts` has NO Page Visibility API implementation\n- If user switches tabs during transition, timeouts will fire and complete the transition unseen\n\n**Missing:**\n```typescript\n// In useTransition.ts - needs to add:\nconst handleVisibilityChange = useCallback(() => {\n  if (document.hidden) {\n    // Pause all transition timeouts\n    // Save elapsed time\n  } else {\n    // Resume transition timers\n    // Adjust for elapsed time\n  }\n}, [transitionState])\n```\n\n### 2. Transition Audio - NOT CONNECTED ❌\n\n**Issue:** The spec (`specs/auto-advance-transitions.md` lines 85-88) requires transition sounds:\n- Fade Out: \"Level Complete\" chime/sound\n- Interstitial: Brief ambient or silence\n- Fade In: \"Level Start\" sound\n\n**Current State:**\n- `SoundEngine` class exists in `lib/audio.ts` with methods:\n  - `playGenerationSound()` - for simulation births\n  - `playInteractionSound()` - for draw/erase actions\n- NO methods for transition-specific sounds\n- `Game.tsx` does NOT instantiate or use `SoundEngine` at all\n- `SoundEngine` is not imported anywhere in the codebase\n\n**Missing:**\n```typescript\n// In SoundEngine - needs to add:\nplayLevelCompleteSound(): void\nplayLevelStartSound(): void\nplayTransitionSound(type: 'fade-out' | 'fade-in'): void\n\n// In Game.tsx - needs to:\n// - Instantiate SoundEngine\n// - Call playLevelCompleteSound() when starting transition\n// - Call playLevelStartSound() after transition completes\n```\n\n### 3. Transition State Not Reset After Completion ❌\n\n**Issue:** The transition system gets stuck in 'READY' state after the first level transition and never returns to 'PLAYING'.\n\n**Current State (Game.tsx):**\n```typescript\n// Lines 101-109: Transition starts when FINISHED phase detected\nuseEffect(() => {\n  if (phaseState.current === 'FINISHED') {\n    window.setTimeout(() => {\n      if (!showVictory) {\n        startTransition()\n      }\n    }, 2000)\n  }\n}, [phaseState.current, showVictory, startTransition])\n\n// Lines 65-80: Callback advances level but doesn't reset transition state\nconst handleTransitionComplete = useCallback(() => {\n  if (isFinalLevel(levelProgression)) {\n    setShowVictory(true)\n  } else {\n    const newProgression = advanceLevel(levelProgression, scoreState.currentScore)\n    setLevelProgression(newProgression)\n    // ... reset grid/flux/generation/score\n    // MISSING: resetTransition() call here!\n  }\n}, [levelProgression, scoreState.currentScore, gridPreset])\n```\n\n**Result:** After `handleTransitionComplete` is called, `transitionState` remains 'READY', so `TransitionOverlay` won't render on subsequent transitions (line 10-11 in TransitionOverlay.tsx returns null for 'READY').\n\n**Missing:**\n```typescript\n// In useTransition hook return:\nreturn {\n  transitionState: transitionState.current,\n  startTransition,\n  skipTransition,\n  resetTransition,  // This exists but is never used\n}\n\n// In Game.tsx - needs to call:\n// resetTransition() after handleTransitionComplete\n```\n\n### 4. Simulation Continues During FINISHED Phase - INCORRECT ⚠️\n\n**Issue:** The spec (`specs/auto-advance-transitions.md` line 34) states \"Continue rendering simulation (visual only, no scoring)\" during FINISHED phase.\n\n**Current State:**\n```typescript\n// Game.tsx lines 139-153: Simulation only runs during RUNNING phase\nuseEffect(() => {\n  let interval: number | undefined\n  if (phaseState.current === 'RUNNING') {\n    interval = window.setInterval(() => {\n      handleSimulationStep()\n    }, simulationSpeed)\n  }\n  // ...\n}, [phaseState, simulationSpeed, handleSimulationStep])\n```\n\n**Result:** Simulation stops immediately when phase becomes FINISHED, contradicting the spec which says it should continue (visual only) during the 2-second FINISHED pause before transition starts.\n\n### 5. Phase System Race Condition - CRITICAL ⚠️\n\n**Issue:** The phase system auto-resets to PLANNING independently of the transition system, creating a race condition.\n\n**Current State (usePhaseTimer.ts lines 121-125):**\n```typescript\nuseEffect(() => {\n  if (phaseState.current === 'FINISHED' && phaseState.canTransition) {\n    resetPhase()\n  }\n}, [phaseState.canTransition, phaseState, resetPhase])\n```\n\n**Flow:**\n1. Timer expires → phase becomes FINISHED\n2. `handleTransitionComplete` is called after transition completes → resets grid/flux\n3. `resetPhase()` is called → phase becomes PLANNING\n4. But `transitionState` remains 'READY', so the game is in a weird state where it's PLANNING but transitionState is not 'PLAYING'\n\n**Expected Flow (from spec):**\n- FINISHED (2s, showing score) → Fade Out → Interstitial → Fade In → READY → PLANNING\n\n### 6. Skip Functionality - PARTIAL ✅\n\n**Status:** Skip functionality works but is incomplete.\n\n**Working:**\n- Space/ESC skips transitions (useTransition.ts lines 63-69)\n- Skip hint is shown during all transition states (TransitionOverlay.tsx lines 49-51)\n\n**Missing from spec:**\n- Spec line 103 says \"Allow holding Space/ESC to skip all transitions\" - not implemented\n- No configuration in Expert Settings to disable skip (spec line 125 says it should be configurable)\n\n## Summary of Critical Issues\n\n| Issue | Severity | Impact |\n|-------|----------|--------|\n| Transition state not reset | CRITICAL | Transitions don't work after first level |\n| Phase/transition race condition | CRITICAL | Game state gets out of sync |\n| Page Visibility API for transitions | HIGH | Transitions complete invisibly when tab hidden |\n| No transition audio | MEDIUM | Missing audio feedback |\n| Simulation stops in FINISHED phase | LOW | Doesn't match spec (visual only) |\n| Skip functionality incomplete | LOW | Minor UX improvement |\n\n## Root Cause\n\nThe main problem is that the transition system and phase system are **disconnected**:\n\n1. `useTransition` manages its own state independently\n2. `usePhaseTimer` manages phase transitions independently\n3. `Game.tsx` tries to coordinate them but misses the reset\n\nThe transition flow should be:\n```\nFINISHED → startTransition() → FADING_OUT → INTERSTITIAL → FADING_IN → \n  READY → onTransitionComplete() → resetTransition() → PLAYING\n```\n\nBut currently it's:\n```\nFINISHED → startTransition() → FADING_OUT → INTERSTITIAL → FADING_IN → \n  READY → onTransitionComplete() → (no reset) → [stays at READY]\n```\n\nAnd simultaneously:\n```\nFINISHED → (2s delay) → resetPhase() → PLANNING\n```\n</task_result>","title":"Check transition system integration","metadata":{"sessionId":"ses_39d4215b6ffefFpnXnrNlj3Y93","model":{"modelID":"glm-4.7","providerID":"zai-coding-plan"},"truncated":false},"time":{"start":1771183139400,"end":1771183218635}}}}
